      "updated": 1783330617223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "部署原则：P0 不强制物理微服务；Phase 1-8 已验证 local/service profile 的核心存储、事件、认证、policy、approval 和工具证据边界。默认拆分顺序：worker -> tool/model gateway -> event pipeline；storage service 等 repository contract 稳定后再拆。API->worker 队列消息必须传 request_id/idempotency_key。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=Phase 9-15 或未来拆分，红虚线=信任边界。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontString": "13px Helvetica",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "部署原则：P0 不强制物理微服务；Phase 1-8 已验证 local/service profile 的核心存储、事件、认证、policy、approval 和工具证据边界。默认拆分顺序：worker -> tool/model gateway -> event pipeline；storage service 等 repository contract 稳定后再拆。API->worker 队列消息必须传 request_id/idempotency_key。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=Phase 9-15 或未来拆分，红虚线=信任边界。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
